  "chem-aqa-8462-2023-p2f::06.1": "Coal is a solid (at room temperature), so it cannot flow through a pipeline — unlike oil (liquid) and natural gas (gas).",
  "chem-aqa-8462-2023-p2f::06.2": "Coal.<br>Reason: coal has the highest percentage by mass of sulfur (5%).",
